In the second test case, `appendKeyValTest`, it creates an instance of `UrlBuilder` with a sample URL, creates a `Connection.KeyVal` object, and calls the `appendKeyVal` method. It then verifies that the resulting URL has the correct query parameters.

Note that this code assumes that the `UrlBuilder` class is in the `org.jsoup.helper` package and that the `Connection.KeyVal` class is also in the same package. If that is not the case, you may need to adjust the imports accordingly.
